{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう直ぐ12月～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年あっという間～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな季節に合わない服装の写メ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなちーちゃんとの写真も貼るね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く美人さん！\n明るくて、お勉強もできる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも明るくて優しいちーちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この服はRの法則できたよ♪\n実際に見たいって声もあったから個別握手会でもきましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートがチャームポイント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会沢山来てくれてありがとうございました。初めての方や 遠くからきてくれて方\nいつも来て下さる方もきてくれたり、お友達も一緒にきてくれたり楽しかったです☺️\n楽しんでもらえたかなぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで頑張って！って応援してくれた方も\nありがとうございます！嬉しい（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう少しで武道館がありますね！\n全部合わせたら4日武道館ライブだ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもテストももうすぐでなにかと両立できてるのか結構不安です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログや755もなかなか出来なくて、焦る気持ちもあります...\n待たせてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバイルメールばかりになっちゃって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれた人達のおかげで実現することができた武道館ライブ\nチケットが取れなかった方の思いも一緒に武道館に立ちます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また成長した姿を見てもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちが届くよう頑張ります♪楽しむぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃん！舞台頑張って♡見に行く～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近沢山雑誌やTVやったりしてるからみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/11/26/3833721/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}